# WORKSTATION.md — Private Local Workstation & Sprite Bindings (Template)

Copy this file to `WORKSTATION.md` (gitignored) so your local coding agent knows your Fly.io org, Sprite URL, and git identity without ever committing private details to the repository.

```bash
cp WORKSTATION.md.example WORKSTATION.md
```

## Git Identity & OPSEC (Optional)
- **Repo-local Git Author:** `<Your Public Name> <your-public@email.com>`
- **Pre-commit Check:** `git grep -i "<sensitive-keyword>"` (must return 0 matches)

## Local Fly.io Sprite Environment
- **Fly.io Organization:** `<your-fly-org>`
- **Default Sprite for this directory:** `lma` (configured via `.sprite`)
- **Live Sprite URL:** `https://<your-sprite>.sprites.app` (Passcode stored in `/home/sprite/.config/lma/web.env` on the Sprite)

